#: mouse.cpp:82
msgid ""
"<h1>Mouse</h1> This module allows you to choose various options for the way in "
"which your pointing device works. Your pointing device may be a mouse, "
"trackball, or some other hardware that performs a similar function."
msgstr ""
"<h1>Küse</h1>Bu bülek kürsätüçe caylanmanıñ niçek eşläyäçägenä bäyle bulğan "
"törle saylanmalar bilgelärgä mömkin itä. Kürsätüçe caylanma küse, ez tubı "
"(trackball) yä ki oxşaş wazífa ütägän cıhaz bula ala."

#: mouse.cpp:101
msgid "&General"
msgstr "&Töptän"

#: mouse.cpp:106
msgid ""
"If you are left-handed, you may prefer to swap the functions of the left and "
"right buttons on your pointing device by choosing the 'left-handed' option. If "
"your pointing device has more than two buttons, only those that function as the "
"left and right buttons are affected. For example, if you have a three-button "
"mouse, the middle button is unaffected."
msgstr ""
"Sulağay bulsañ, kürsätüçe caylanmañnıñ uñ häm sul töymälären 'sulağay' "
"saylanmasın tamğalap alıştıra alasıñ. Kürsätüçe caylanmanıñ ikedän artıq töymä "
"bulsa, uñ häm sul töymä wazífasın ütägän töymälär genä almaşınır. Mäsälän, öç "
"töymäle küsedä urta töymä üzgäreş kürmäs."

#: mouse.cpp:116
msgid ""
"The default behavior in KDE is to select and activate icons with a single click "
"of the left button on your pointing device. This behavior is consistent with "
"what you would expect when you click links in most web browsers. If you would "
"prefer to select with a single click, and activate with a double click, check "
"this option."
msgstr ""
"KDE'da ikonnarnı ber basu belän saylaw häm açu bar bulğan dip bilgeländän. Bu "
"qılanış gizgeçlärneñ kübesendä sıltamalarğa basu belän tiñ. Ägär dä yalğız basu "
"belän saylarğa, qabat basu belän açarğa teläsäñ, bu saylanmanı tamğala."

#: mouse.cpp:124
msgid "Activates and opens a file or folder with a single click."
msgstr "Birem yä törgäkne yalğız basu belän saylí da aça."

#: mouse.cpp:130
msgid ""
"If you check this option, pausing the mouse pointer over an icon on the screen "
"will automatically select that icon. This may be useful when single clicks "
"activate icons, and you want only to select the icon without activating it."
msgstr ""
"Monı saylasañ, küse kürsätkeçeneñ ekrandağı ikonnıñ östendä tuqtaw ikonnıñ "
"automatik saylanmasına kiterer. Bu, yalğız basu ikonnarnı aça dip köylängändä, "
"ikonnı açmíça saylarğa mömkinlek birä."

#: mouse.cpp:142
msgid ""
"If you have checked the option to automatically select icons, this slider "
"allows you to select how long the mouse pointer must be paused over the icon "
"before it is selected."
msgstr ""
"İkonnarnıñ automatik saylanmasın tamğalağan bulsañ, bu şuğıç belän ikonnıñ "
"saylanması öçen kürsätkeçneñ ul ikon östendä niqädär torırğa kirägen köyli "
"alasıñ."

#: mouse.cpp:147
msgid "Show feedback when clicking an icon"
msgstr "İkonğa basqanda kire eteşne kürsät"

#: mouse.cpp:179
msgid "&Cursor Theme"
msgstr "&Kürsär Tışlawı"

#: mouse.cpp:183
msgid "Advanced"
msgstr "Kiñäytep"

#: mouse.cpp:189
msgid "Pointer acceleration:"
msgstr "Kürsätkeç tizläneşe:"

#: mouse.cpp:194
msgid ""
"This option allows you to change the relationship between the distance that the "
"mouse pointer moves on the screen and the relative movement of the physical "
"device itself (which may be a mouse, trackball, or some other pointing device.)"
"<p> A high value for the acceleration will lead to large movements of the mouse "
"pointer on the screen even when you only make a small movement with the "
"physical device. Selecting very high values may result in the mouse pointer "
"flying across the screen, making it hard to control."
msgstr ""
"Bu saylanma küse kürsätkeçeneñ ekrän buylap quzğalğanı häm fizik caylanmanıñ "
"(küse yä ki başqa kürsätü caylanması) xäräkäte arasında bäyläneşne üzgärtergä "
"mömkinlek birä."
"<p> Zur tizläneşlärdä, fizik caylanma belän beraz ğına xäräkät itsägez dä, küse "
"kürsätkeçe ekranda yıraqqa quzğalır. Bik zur tizläneşlär saylaw kürsätkeçneñ "
"ekran buylap oçuına, citäkläwneñ bik qíın buluına kiterä ala."

#: mouse.cpp:207
msgid "Pointer threshold:"
msgstr "Çirtkeç çige:"

#: mouse.cpp:215
msgid ""
"The threshold is the smallest distance that the mouse pointer must move on the "
"screen before acceleration has any effect. If the movement is smaller than the "
"threshold, the mouse pointer moves as if the acceleration was set to 1X;"
"<p> thus, when you make small movements with the physical device, there is no "
"acceleration at all, giving you a greater degree of control over the mouse "
"pointer. With larger movements of the physical device, you can move the mouse "
"pointer rapidly to different areas on the screen."
msgstr ""
"Tizlätü başlağançı küse uğı küçärgä tieş aranıñ iñ kime. Aña tikle küçkändä "
"tizlätü arttıruı 1x bulıp sanala, yäğni berkileş"
"<p>Keçe aralarda küçkändä tizlätü qullanılmağaç tögäl urınğa küçep bula. Olı "
"arağa küçkändä isä, küse uğın küräkneñ ikençe yanına tiz itep küçerep bula."

#: mouse.cpp:229
msgid "Double click interval:"
msgstr "Qabat çirtü arası:"

#: mouse.cpp:231 mouse.cpp:249 mouse.cpp:303 mouse.cpp:311 mouse.cpp:320
msgid " msec"
msgstr " msek"

#: mouse.cpp:236
msgid ""
"The double click interval is the maximal time (in milliseconds) between two "
"mouse clicks which turns them into a double click. If the second click happens "
"later than this time interval after the first click, they are recognized as two "
"separate clicks."
msgstr ""
"Qabat çirtü arası - küsegä ike çirtüne ber qabat çirtü itep sanarğa röxsät "
"itkän waqıtnıñ iñ zur zurlığı (millisekundlarda). İkençe çirtü berençedän bu "
"aradan ozaqqa soñğa qalsa, alar ike ayırım çirtu itep sanalalar."

#: mouse.cpp:247
msgid "Drag start time:"
msgstr "Österäw başlanu waqıtı:"

#: mouse.cpp:254
msgid ""
"If you click with the mouse (e.g. in a multi-line editor) and begin to move the "
"mouse within the drag start time, a drag operation will be initiated."
msgstr ""
"Küse belän çirtep (mäs. küpyullı tözätkeçtä) küsene österäw waqıtı betmiçä "
"quzğatsañ, österäw ğämäle başqarılır."

#: mouse.cpp:260
msgid "Drag start distance:"
msgstr "Österäw başlaw yıraqlığı"

#: mouse.cpp:268
msgid ""
"If you click with the mouse and begin to move the mouse at least the drag start "
"distance, a drag operation will be initiated."
msgstr ""
"Küsene çirtep kimendä österäw yıraqlığına xäräkät itsäñ, österäw ğämäle "
"başqarılır."

#: mouse.cpp:274
msgid "Mouse wheel scrolls by:"
msgstr "Küse tägärmäçeneñ şuu arası:"

#: mouse.cpp:282
msgid ""
"If you use the wheel of a mouse, this value determines the number of lines to "
"scroll for each wheel movement. Note that if this number exceeds the number of "
"visible lines, it will be ignored and the wheel movement will be handled as a "
"page up/down movement."
msgstr ""
"Küse tägärmäçen qullansañ, bu zurlıq tägärmäçneñ här xäräkätendä niçä yul "
"şuaçağın bilgelär. San kürengän yullar sanınnan artıq bulsa, aña ähämiät "
"birelmäs häm tägärmäçneñ xäräkäte Bit Öskä/Bit Asqa xäräkäte itep sanalır."

